CONTROL bytes: detected
CONTROL records: detected
CONTROL clock: detected
CONTROL configured-clock: detected
CONTROL system-clock: detected
CONTROL ignore-off-timing: detected planted grading change
CONTROL off-time-limit: boundary and one-tick-over detected
PASS: capture census, clocks, both timing arms and receipt agree
gate rc=0
--mutation bytes rc=1
--mutation records rc=1
--mutation clock rc=1
--mutation ignore-off-timing rc=1
